  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine the cheese, curds, turmeric, garam masala, and berbere spice.",
    "2. Gradually add in the water and mix until a dough forms.",
    "3. Heat the oil in a skillet over medium heat.",
    "4. Using a spoon, drop small balls of the dough into the hot oil and flatten slightly with a spatula.",
    "5. Cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, until golden brown and crispy.",
    "6. Remove from oil and drain on paper towels.",
    "7. Serve hot and enjoy!"
